{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Batch records"},"description":"Jusqu\u2019\u00e0 50 op\u00e9rations sur les ressources du catalogue. Lire describe_resources ; update exige data.version. R\u00e9sultats individuels index/ref, succ\u00e8s conserv\u00e9s, arr\u00eat au premier \u00e9chec par d\u00e9faut ; stopOnError:false traite les op\u00e9rations EN PARALL\u00c8LE (4 \u00e0 la fois, un m\u00eame enregistrement reste dans l\u2019ordre). Non atomique et sans rejeu automatique : apr\u00e8s timeout relire les ressources, ne pas dupliquer les cr\u00e9ations. Les actions m\u00e9tier prot\u00e9g\u00e9es utilisent batch_actions.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"items":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"action":{"enum":["create","update","delete","duplicate"],"type":"string"},"data":{"additionalProperties":{},"type":"object"},"id":{"exclusiveMinimum":0,"type":"integer"},"ref":{"maxLength":100,"type":"string"},"type":{"enum":["flows","agents","tasks","segments","contacts","tags","funnels","sites","pages","newsletters","campaigns","campaign_steps","automations","products","coupons","orders","subscriptions","invoices","courses","modules","lessons","assignments","enrollments","communities","posts","community_members","comments","calendars","bookings","pipelines","prospect_searches","prospects","deals","webinars","affiliates","commissions","blogs","articles","domains","templates","sms","social_posts","ad_campaigns","outreach_messages","whatsapp","telegram","links","posters","presentations","assets"],"type":"string"}},"required":["action","type"],"type":"object"},"maxItems":50,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"stopOnError":{"default":true,"type":"boolean"}},"required":["items"],"type":"object"},"name":"batch_records","title":"Batch records"}
